<title>USA: Purity Supreme buys back 11-3/4 pct Sr. notes.</title>
<headline>Purity Supreme buys back 11-3/4 pct Sr. notes.</headline>
<dateline>QUINCY, Mass. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Purity Supreme Inc said on Tuesday it started a cash tender offer on September 20 to repurchase all its outstanding 11-3/4 percent Senior Secured Notes due 1999.</p>
<p>Purity said in a statement it would buy the notes at $1,075 per $1,000 principal amount, plus accrued and unpaid interest up to but not including the date of acceptance.</p>
</text>
